---
- op: replace
  path: /metadata/name
  value: mcp-hindsight-persona
- op: add
  path: /spec/toolsOverride
  value:
    retain:
      description: >-
        Store a derived persona memory (real preferences, experiences,
        relationships). NEVER retain raw tool outputs, file contents,
        credentials, or verbatim API responses; distill first. Do not write
        fictional/simulation state here. Tag consistently using existing tags
        (see list_tags).
    recall:
      description: >-
        Search persona memories. Prefer reflect for synthesized answers; use
        recall only when individual memory entries are needed.
